       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TWODTABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GRID.
           05 GRID-ROW OCCURS 3 TIMES.
               10 GRID-CELL PIC 9(2) OCCURS 3 TIMES.
       01 R PIC 9(1).
       01 C PIC 9(1).
       01 VALUE-COUNTER PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
       01 ROW-TOTAL PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING R FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL R > 3
               PERFORM VARYING C FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL C > 3
                   ADD 1 TO VALUE-COUNTER
                   MOVE VALUE-COUNTER TO GRID-CELL(R, C)
               END-PERFORM
           END-PERFORM

           PERFORM VARYING R FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL R > 3
               MOVE 0 TO ROW-TOTAL
               PERFORM VARYING C FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL C > 3
                   ADD GRID-CELL(R, C) TO ROW-TOTAL
               END-PERFORM
               DISPLAY "ROW " R " TOTAL: " ROW-TOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
